# Runtime state of a workspace, never source
/.agent/
**/.semantic-engine/

# The event store is derived state, regenerable from sessions via
# `npm run backfill:eventstore`; it is never committed.
**/.agent/eventstore/

# scratch: pristine HEAD copies and throwaway repros used by the audit
# workflow (see FIX-PLAN-REVIEW-FINDINGS.md, section 10) - never commit
/tmp-baseline/
